{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/Tri_tags_and_panel-03.png?t=1743447259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tri Survive is a Roguelite RPG set in a fantasy medieval world filled with magical creatures and kingdoms to explore. Take control of three characters simultaneously, each with their own skill set and unique abilities, deemed to be the heroes of their nations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, your home is suddenly invaded by demonic creatures from another dimension.<br>The three champions must unite their forces to stop the invasion and unravel the mystery surrounding the evil monsters wreaking havoc in your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743447259\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three Heroes, One Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Tri Survive, you will simultaneously take control of three heroes and experience unique game strategies. All the characters at your disposal will offer different abilities tied to their role as Tank, DPS, or Healer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new champions as you progress in the story, and activate several synergies between the party members to be tailored to your playstyle and preference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1_.gif?t=1743447259\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World of Tri Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a medieval fantasy world, Tri Survive lets you experience the adventure through the eyes of seasoned heroes from different nations and backgrounds who suddenly find themselves amid an invasion by demonic creatures from another dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey to free your home from the invaders, you will explore countless hand-drawn landscapes and cities to gather information on what is happening in the world and discover how these monsters managed to breach your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/1-ezgif.com-optimize_2_.gif?t=1743447259\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive The Horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to take a break from saving the world and test your skills? The Endless Survivor Mode is the challenge you are looking for!<br>Fight infinite waves of monsters and train with your favorite heroes unlocked during the Campaign by measuring your skills and survival instincts. Get a personal score at the end of each run and prove yourself and the world to be worthy of the heroes trusting your commands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072970?t=1743447259","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/5dcf68444d34db7e5e96d06ebce7bafa78d1e70e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743447259","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/b860ee17ce76e21f8c1804e3848a38be9869d9cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743447259","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/b860ee17ce76e21f8c1804e3848a38be9869d9cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743447259","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/Tri_tags_and_panel-03.png?t=1743447259\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tri Survive is a Roguelite RPG set in a fantasy medieval world filled with magical creatures and kingdoms to explore. Take control of three characters simultaneously, each with their own skill set and unique abilities, deemed to be the heroes of their nations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, your home is suddenly invaded by demonic creatures from another dimension.<br>The three champions must unite their forces to stop the invasion and unravel the mystery surrounding the evil monsters wreaking havoc in your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1743447259\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three Heroes, One Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Tri Survive, you will simultaneously take control of three heroes and experience unique game strategies. All the characters at your disposal will offer different abilities tied to their role as Tank, DPS, or Healer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new champions as you progress in the story, and activate several synergies between the party members to be tailored to your playstyle and preference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter_1_.gif?t=1743447259\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World of Tri Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a medieval fantasy world, Tri Survive lets you experience the adventure through the eyes of seasoned heroes from different nations and backgrounds who suddenly find themselves amid an invasion by demonic creatures from another dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey to free your home from the invaders, you will explore countless hand-drawn landscapes and cities to gather information on what is happening in the world and discover how these monsters managed to breach your kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/extras/1-ezgif.com-optimize_2_.gif?t=1743447259\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Survive The Horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to take a break from saving the world and test your skills? The Endless Survivor Mode is the challenge you are looking for!<br>Fight infinite waves of monsters and train with your favorite heroes unlocked during the Campaign by measuring your skills and survival instincts. Get a personal score at the end of each run and prove yourself and the world to be worthy of the heroes trusting your commands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Majestic Mind Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072970/7e4cf387454e38b755bcc5d1978bc4c495eaea6f/header.jpg?t=1743447259","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120404,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120404/movie480.mp4?t=1743423170","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120404/movie_max.mp4?t=1743423170"},"name":"Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120404/36398db18e62addd65697af35b43a26886d248ad/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743423170","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120404/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743423170","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120404/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743423170"}}],"name":"Tri Survive","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 10 capable G